g2p.js turns text into phonemes in the misaki phoneme set used by the
Kokoro-82M voice (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro). It
contains no GPL-licensed code or data.

kokoro.js runs Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0) through transformers.js
(Apache-2.0, https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.js); parts of it
follow kokoro-js (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro), as noted
in that file.


